From 1b75b04b429486586ef64f8200a061d05114c1ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Karol Gugala <kgugala@antmicro.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Apr 2025 18:10:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Prevent bus stalling

Do not stall bus on reading from empty FIFO or writing to full.
Reads from empty FIFOs return 0, writes to full FIFOs are ignored.

Signed-off-by: Karol Gugala <kgugala@antmicro.com>
---
 src/hci/tti.sv                                | 71 +++++++++-----
 src/i3c.sv                                    |  4 +
 src/recovery/recovery_handler.sv              |  2 +
 .../hci_queues_ahb/hci_queues_wrapper.sv      |  4 +
 .../hci_queues_axi/hci_queues_wrapper.sv      |  4 +
 .../lib_hci_queues/test_read_write_ports.py   | 97 -------------------
 .../cocotb/block/lib_hci_queues/tti_queues.py |  3 +
 .../cocotb/top/lib_i3c_top/test_bus_stall.py  | 77 +++++++++++++++
 8 files changed, 141 insertions(+), 121 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 verification/cocotb/top/lib_i3c_top/test_bus_stall.py

